# Place custom photographer images here

## Image naming convention:
- `{slug}-logo.{jpg|jpeg|png|webp}` - Profile image (400×400 px)
- `{slug}-cover.{jpg|jpeg|png|webp}` - Cover image (1200×400 px)

## Slugs:
- `hh-production`
- `kap-studio`
- `amaras-studio`
- `cj-creatives`
- `joesol-photography`
- `frederick-robelas`

## Example:
```
images/
├── hh-production-logo.jpg
├── hh-production-cover.jpg
├── kap-studio-logo.jpg
├── kap-studio-cover.jpg
└── ...
```

If images are not found, the seeder will generate colorful placeholder images automatically.
